<title>ARGENTINA: South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</title>
<headline>South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South American vegoil and subproduct export offer/bid prices at close September 9 as quoted by the J.J. Hinnrichsen brokerage (in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>ARGENTINA, FOB Argentine ports</p>
<p>Peanutoil  Oct/Nov 850/-</p>
<p>Soy oil    Sep 530/527 Oct 538/535 Nov/Dec 550/545</p>
<p>Sunoil     Sep 535/530 Oct 542/533</p>
<p>Linsd oil  Sep/Oct 470/461</p>
<p>Ctnsd oil  -/-</p>
<p>Soy plts  Sep -20/-22 Oct/Dec -17/-19 Jan/Mar -13/-16</p>
<p>	    May/Sep -31/-33</p>
<p>Sunplts   Oct/Dec 145/135 Jan/Mar 140/130 Apr/Jun 135/125</p>
<p>Ctn plts  Oct 170/160 Nov -/165  Lin expl  unq</p>
<p>Brazil, FOB Paranagua</p>
<p>Soy plts  Sep +3/option Oct/Dec +3/option  May/Sep -24/-26</p>
<p>Parana-Rotterdam freight was stable from last week at $17 a tonne FISTLO.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
